{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kunobi-ninja/kache/pulls/1497","id":4814178442,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRBv5c8AAAABHvKIig","html_url":"https://github.com/kunobi-ninja/kache/pull/1497","diff_url":"https://github.com/kunobi-ninja/kache/pull/1497.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kunobi-ninja/kache/pull/1497.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kunobi-ninja/kache/issues/1497","number":1497,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"perf: seed adaptive incremental state from emitted dep-info","user":{"login":"jleni","id":13698520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjk4NTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13698520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni","html_url":"https://github.com/jleni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A first source edit could run rustc once to discover inputs, then again to seed private incremental state. Learning units now start a cold private compile and qualify its seed from the dep-info that compile emits.\n\nA local artifact hit stops non-linking rustc before metadata is forwarded to Cargo, then follows the existing restore path. Qualified seeds update private incremental state without storing their artifacts in the cache. The unit lock covers qualification and cleanup; failed or cancelled attempts retain learning, while unqualified success clears it so a later build can store normally. Active re-probes and linking units keep the existing discovery path.\n\nValidation: `just check` in an isolated environment; policy, no-fallback edit/error/hit tests, and workspace race tests. Empty-entry, RSS-on-hit and rebuilt-output tests each fail under their corresponding mutation. [CI](https://github.com/kunobi-ninja/kache/actions/runs/38086934249) passed on `a4610038`, including all four changed-line mutation shards and executed platform jobs; Nix was skipped.\n\nSix paired Kobe runs on this exact head, with phase tracing disabled, measured Aube initial builds at 76.59 seconds versus 82.91 seconds for v1.0. The median paired change was -7.65% (95% interval -8.49% to -6.93%). First edits measured 36.72 versus 36.23 seconds, with a median paired change of +0.65% (95% interval -0.73% to +2.75%). Changes are medians of the six per-pair percentage changes.\n\nSix paired Kobe warm-build comparisons on the same head found unchanged builds +25.05% (95% interval +21.01% to +26.02%) slower than v1.0 and documentation-edit builds +22.09% (95% interval +17.77% to +25.45%) slower. Each restored 674 units with zero misses and three passthroughs. These regressions block release. Release PR #1494 remains a draft until the final release head clears performance validation.\n","created_at":"2026-10-10T20:21:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T23:30:29Z","closed_at":"2026-10-10T23:29:19Z","merged_at":"2026-10-10T23:29:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"4ee0f9e2b9673aa16f29c9c7e39bf8d0152671d9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kunobi-ninja/kache/pulls/1497/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kunobi-ninja/kache/pulls/1497/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kunobi-ninja/kache/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kunobi-ninja/kache/issues/1497/comments","statuses_url":"https://api